{"id":"estadi_stico","lemma":"estadístico","pos":"adj","rank":4738,"glosses":["statistic"],"ipa":"/estaˈdistiko/","forms":{"feminine":"estadística","masculinePlural":"estadísticos","femininePlural":"estadísticas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c0/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-estad%C3%ADstico.wav","formAudio":{"estadística":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c4/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-estad%C3%ADstica.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Las estadísticas están a nuestro favor.","en":"The statistics are in our favor.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/586645","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"our, ours, to us"},{"g":"favor/favour"}]},{"text":"Las estadísticas están de tu lado.","en":"The statistics are in your favor.","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"side"}]},{"text":"Las estadísticas son alarmantes.","en":"The statistics are shocking.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/586644","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"alarming","l":"alarmante"}]},{"text":"La muerte de un hombre es una tragedia, la de millones, una estadística.","en":"The death of one man is a tragedy. The death of millions is a statistic.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/693698","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"death"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"man"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"tragedy, catastrophe"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"million","l":"millón"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Las estadísticas no siempre te dicen toda la verdad.","en":"Statistics don't always tell the whole story.","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"always"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to say","l":"decir"},{"g":"all","l":"todo"},null,null],"phrases":[[7,9,"honestly, to be honest"]]}]}